  "note": "Borough election, 15 October 1937. Castle and Ballyholme were contested; Princetown, Dufferin and Clifton returned one member each unopposed. Only candidate nominated for Dufferin Ward, where the retiring member, Mr. Isaac Baxter, did not seek re-election. Returned unopposed."
